    rdfs:comment "measure that is modifying risk (3.61) Note 1 to entry: Controls include any process (3.54), policy (3.53), device, practice, or other actions which modify risk (3.61). Note 2 to entry: It is possible that controls not always exert the intended or assumed modifying effect."@en ;
    skos:definition "measure that is modifying risk (3.61) Note 1 to entry: Controls include any process (3.54), policy (3.53), device, practice, or other actions which modify risk (3.61). Note 2 to entry: It is possible that controls not always exert the intended or assumed modifying effect."@en ;
