    rdfs:comment "preservation of confidentiality (3.10), integrity (3.36) and availability (3.7) of information Note 1 to entry: In addition, other properties, such as authenticity (3.6), accountability, non-repudiation (3.48), and reliability (3.55) can also be involved."@en ;
    skos:definition "preservation of confidentiality (3.10), integrity (3.36) and availability (3.7) of information Note 1 to entry: In addition, other properties, such as authenticity (3.6), accountability, non-repudiation (3.48), and reliability (3.55) can also be involved."@en ;
