    rdfs:comment "person or group of people that has its own functions with responsibilities, authorities and relationships to achieve its objectives (3.49) Note 1 to entry: The concept of organization includes but is not limited to sole-trader, company, corporation, firm, enterprise, authority, partnership, charity or institution, or part or combination thereof, whether incorporated or not, public or private."@en ;
    skos:definition "person or group of people that has its own functions with responsibilities, authorities and relationships to achieve its objectives (3.49) Note 1 to entry: The concept of organization includes but is not limited to sole-trader, company, corporation, firm, enterprise, authority, partnership, charity or institution, or part or combination thereof, whether incorporated or not, public or private."@en ;
    skos:inScheme arkcscSKOS: ;
    skos:note "person or group of people that has its own functions with responsibilities, authorities and relationships to achieve its objectives (3.49) Note 1 to entry: The concept of organization includes but is not limited to sole-trader, company, corporation, firm, enterprise, authority, partnership, charity or institution, or part or combination thereof, whether incorporated or not, public or private."@en ;
