    skos:note "process (3.54) to comprehend the nature of risk (3.61) and to determine the level of risk (3.39) Note 1 to entry: Risk analysis provides the basis for risk evaluation (3.67) and decisions about risk treatment (3.72). Note 2 to entry: Risk analysis includes risk estimation."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Risk analysis"@en .

